            "title": "Wolverine Asset Management LLC Expands Portfolio with Patria Latin American Opportunity ...",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "On September 30, 2024, Wolverine Asset Management LLC made a significant addition to its investment portfolio by acquiring 405,308 shares of Patria Latin American Opportunity Acquisition Corp (NASDAQ:PLAO).  This transaction, executed at a price of $11.61 per share, marks a strategic expansion by the firm, reflecting a 0.1% position in its portfolio and an 8.92% ownership in PLAO.  Based in Chicago, Wolverine Asset Management LLC is a prominent investment firm known for its dynamic investment strategies and a diverse portfolio.",
